Thus we need to prepare destination_availability_alpha and origin_availability_alpha similarly to shift_candidate_alpha? Many of these predicates are similar to those needed for a schedule_candidate but for origin/destination availabilities (which are also candidate_entity types). They have similar actions for preparing, allocating vehicle, linking task profile, confirming preparedness, allocating vehicle, etc. Also need to load payload, lock availability, etc.

We already have many predicates true initially for origin_availability_alpha: candidate_created, vehicle_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked to vehicle_unit_alpha. However we need candidate_prepared for origin_availability_alpha (goal). Initially we have not candidate_prepared for origin_availability_alpha. Similarly for destination_availability_alpha: candidate_created true, but need candidate_prepared, candidate_task_profile_linked, candidate_vehicle_linked to vehicle_unit_beta, etc.

Also need to allocate vehicle_unit_beta to destination_availability_alpha (currently vehicle_available vehicle_unit_beta). Also need vehicle_allocated destination_availability_alpha true.

Need candidate_task_profile_linked destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (currently route_task_profile_available true). Need to attach_task_profile.

Need candidate_prepared for both origin and destination.

Need origin_availability_confirmed, locked, origin_node_occupied and ready, etc. We currently have origin_availability_node_linked true, but origin_node_ready? Not initially. We have origin_node_ready? Not listed in init. So we need to activate origin node, load payload, lock availability.

Similarly for destination.

Also need transport_leg_assembled etc. Currently transport_leg_available true. Need to assemble leg (requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed). So we need to lock and confirm availabilities, activate nodes, load payload.

